  "endpointLaws": [
    "Object selection, bitmaps, overlap, reference counting, ordering and waiter lists execute owned CPU code.",
    "Only actual RTOS dispatch, semaphore, notification and kernel log services remain retained endpoints.",
    "A failed overlap wait returns its exact error and retains the registered waiter; a successful wait clears its notification then removes the matching waiter before selection reentry.",
